	(text "USB-C (J1, HRO TYPE-C-31-M-12): native USB of the ESP32-S3 (programming + serial).\nVBUS feeds only the logic (D7 SS34 -> 3.3 V buck, see Power Conversion): never motors or servos, never the AA cells.\nWith USB plugged in the logic runs from USB (5 V is above a NiMH battery). R9/R10 5.1k on CC1/CC2 = USB sink.\nShield to GND through C48 (4.7 nF). C47 (10 uF) buffers VBUS at the connector."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
